WEBVTT

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:59.980
That we are going to be myself to unite the soul of God.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:10.490
God ye, daughter of Egypt, with the body of Asana, priestess of Oblasti, that to us he may remain supreme of the century to come.

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:29.980
That was a close one. Why, it must be two miles...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:47.110
the bottom of that canyon. Are you going to call him a yogi, Uncle Frank?

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.320
I am listening, my teacher.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:21.730
The opposing forces of evil are strong, my son, but let not thy fear control me.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:29.920
But my teacher, Najee is a prisoner of the Uvasti, and she's engraved.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.010
Danger is unknown to the true believer.

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:38.140
Have faith, my son.

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:42.210
My teacher, where is she?

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.530
Again, I say, let not thy fears control thee.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.550
Have faith, my son.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.150
Have faith.

00:04:08.508 --> 00:04:09.788
Open that others down, Uncle Frank.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:15.120
Those drums are the evil forces of black magic.

00:04:15.804 --> 00:04:17.004
Are they stronger than the yogi?

00:04:18.812 --> 00:04:19.252
horses.

00:04:19.644 --> 00:04:21.564
are in eternal conflict.

00:04:23.452 --> 00:04:24.272
But the yogi said,

00:04:24.892 --> 00:04:25.192
have.

00:04:25.372 --> 00:04:25.632
Bye.

00:06:04.796 --> 00:06:07.296
I shall awaken only at my command.

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:12.120
Thou shalt be on thy way to the moon.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:23.420
An hour you will drive to the harbor and place the sarcophagus upon our ship.

00:06:24.732 --> 00:06:26.912
I will go and make preparations to leave at once.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.400
All right, Uncle Frank, you sure did that in a hurry.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:23.780
Go, step on it.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.160
Princess Nigel.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:39.080
What is she?

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:40.070
What happened?

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:41.630
What did you do?

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:12.640
Saint Ani, what do you really think of Shandu's condition?

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:15.000
This is the fifth day of it.

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:17.690
No known drug will last that long.

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.800
The occult powers of Shandu have failed to awaken.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.180
It can be but one answer.

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:26.830
You mean black magic?

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:52.200
can do with you to awake, to awaken.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.930
Uncle Frank, is not he awake yet?

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:11.250
Did you call him a yogi, Uncle Frank?

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:12.250
Yes.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:16.040
Forces of evil are supreme at the moment.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.190
Jungle drums drown out the other toe.

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:20.200
Mr. Chandler.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:20.710
Yes.

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.120
Can I please have a word with you?

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:23.510
All right.

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:24.790
You'll excuse us?

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:25.200
Certainly.

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.970
Well, you can watch your flying fish.

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:35.680
Flying fish.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:48.300
And I'm afraid.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.700
That's what I wanted to speak to you about.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:51.300
That's orbit.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.060
You know everything, don't you, Smoggy?

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.360
Betty, there's a light.

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:06.280
probably another boat. Boats always carry life at night, don't they? Don't fly signals out in the

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:11.420
middle of the ocean. Look, there it is again. I think you'd better tell Uncle Frank. Just because

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:15.120
you're landing on a boat, Uncle Frank has enough trouble.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:30.730
done.
